    "preamble": "Heni Loukil.pdf | Contact\nwww.linkedin.com/in/heni-loukil-\naa4891240  (LinkedIn)\nTop Skills\nDevOps\nDeep Learning\nNestJSHeni Loukil\nMachine Learning Engineer at InstaDeep\nSfax, Tunisia",
    "experience": "InstaDeep\nMachine Learning Engineer\nJanuary 2025 - Present  (1 year 2 months)\nICube Strasbourg\nGeometric Deep Learning Intern\nFebruary 2024 - August 2024  (7 months)\nStrasbourg, Grand Est, France\nThis Graduation Internship entitled \"Alzheimer's Disease Classification Using\nHippocampal Shape Morphometric Analysis with Geometric Deep Learning\"\nfocused on Deep Graph CNN for Non-rigid registration and matching.\nProjecting Hippocampus shape into the pre-shape space based on Kendall’s\ndefinition, and  then into the shape space in order to ensure accurate geodesic\npaths between shapes and invariance in parametrization. We then extracted\nDense vector fields features in order to perform triple classification and\nexceeded all state of the art methods. We also determined most affected\nregions of Hippocampi by Alzheimer based on tangent vectors on geodesic\ndistances.",
